agentic-telemetry-spec

Copyright 2026 Jonathan A. Bowe

This project contains a JSON Schema specification for decision-audit telemetry
on Claude Code primitives (tool calls, agent sessions, A/B experiments, KoTH
oracle comparisons, decision logging, and backward-compatibility tracking).

The schemas were derived from internal KellerAI design work and sanitized for
public release on 2026-05-20.

